{"id":"78d28df95528f987","group":"58","path":"58/batch20/58-df-zfc-pcf4-scale-coherence.md","title":"ZFC Pcf4 Scale Coherence","display":"df-zfc-pcf4-scale-coherence — ZFC Pcf4 Scale Coherence","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-pcf4-scale-coherence","aliases":["58-df-zfc-pcf4-scale-coherence"],"display":"df-zfc-pcf4-scale-coherence — ZFC Pcf4 Scale Coherence","depends_on":["[[58-df-zfc-pcf2-scale]]","[[58-df-zfc-pcf3-eventual-order]]","[[58-df-ordinal]]","[[58-df-function]]","[[../batch01/58-df-limitordinal.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-pcf4-scale-coherence"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-pcf4-scale-coherence</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-pcf4-scale-coherence — ZFC Pcf4 Scale Coherence"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"255774e81caebda9\" href=\"?note=255774e81caebda9\" title=\"58-df-zfc-pcf2-scale\">58-df-zfc-pcf2-scale</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"fd3c35fd522d89ac\" href=\"?note=fd3c35fd522d89ac\" title=\"58-df-zfc-pcf3-eventual-order\">58-df-zfc-pcf3-eventual-order</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"58-df-ordinal\">58-df-ordinal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"81cabbac7fa4d75d\" href=\"?note=81cabbac7fa4d75d\" title=\"../batch01/58-df-limitordinal.md\">../batch01/58-df-limitordinal.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in V\">\\(A\\in V\\)</span> (pcf index set)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J,\\lambda,\\vec f\\in V\">\\(J,\\lambda,\\vec f\\in V\\)</span> (ideal, scale length, and scale sequence).</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha,\\beta,\\delta\\in\\lambda\">\\(\\alpha,\\beta,\\delta\\in\\lambda\\)</span> (scale indices).</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\\in V\">\\(P\\in V\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g\\in P\">\\(g\\in P\\)</span> (bounded product carrier and test function)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{LimitOrdinal}_S\">\\(\\operatorname{LimitOrdinal}_S\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcPcf2Scale}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcPcf2Scale}_S\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcPcf3EventualOrder}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcPcf3EventualOrder}_S\\)</span> (source predicates).</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcPcf4ScaleCoherence}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcPcf4ScaleCoherence}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}pcf4\\text{-}scale\\text{-}coherence} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcPcf4ScaleCoherence}_S(A,J,\\lambda,\\vec f)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{ZfcPcf2Scale}_S(A,J,\\lambda,\\vec f)\\land\\exists P\\in V\\;\\Bigl[P=\\{g\\in\\mathcal P(A\\times\\bigcup A):\\mathrm{Function}(g,A,\\bigcup A)\\land\\forall a\\in A\\;(g(a)\\in a)\\}\\land\\forall\\delta\\in\\lambda\\;\\Bigl(\\operatorname{LimitOrdinal}_S(\\delta)\\to\\forall g\\in P\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{ZfcPcf3EventualOrder}_S(A,J,g,\\vec f(\\delta))\\to\\exists\\alpha&lt;\\delta\\;\\mathrm{ZfcPcf3EventualOrder}_S(A,J,g,\\vec f(\\alpha))\\bigr)\\Bigr)\\Bigr]\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}pcf4\\text{-}scale\\text{-}coherence} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcPcf4ScaleCoherence}_S(A,J,\\lambda,\\vec f)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{ZfcPcf2Scale}_S(A,J,\\lambda,\\vec f)\\land\\exists P\\in V\\;\\Bigl[P=\\{g\\in\\mathcal P(A\\times\\bigcup A):\\mathrm{Function}(g,A,\\bigcup A)\\land\\forall a\\in A\\;(g(a)\\in a)\\}\\land\\forall\\delta\\in\\lambda\\;\\Bigl(\\operatorname{LimitOrdinal}_S(\\delta)\\to\\forall g\\in P\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{ZfcPcf3EventualOrder}_S(A,J,g,\\vec f(\\delta))\\to\\exists\\alpha&lt;\\delta\\;\\mathrm{ZfcPcf3EventualOrder}_S(A,J,g,\\vec f(\\alpha))\\bigr)\\Bigr)\\Bigr]\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The product is an explicit bounded set of function graphs.  The upstream scale predicate supplies monotonicity and cofinality; the limit clause says that <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f_\\delta\">\\(f_\\delta\\)</span> is an exact upper bound modulo the same ideal.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-zfc-pcf2-scale","status":"resolved","id":"255774e81caebda9","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-pcf2-scale]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-pcf3-eventual-order","status":"resolved","id":"fd3c35fd522d89ac","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-pcf3-eventual-order]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-ordinal","status":"resolved","id":"5582a281f15a33c2","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-ordinal]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch01/58-df-limitordinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"81cabbac7fa4d75d","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch01/58-df-limitordinal.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"J,\\lambda,\\vec f\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\alpha,\\beta,\\delta\\in\\lambda","display":false},{"tex":"P\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"g\\in P","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{LimitOrdinal}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcPcf2Scale}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcPcf3EventualOrder}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcPcf4ScaleCoherence}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}pcf4\\text{-}scale\\text{-}coherence} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcPcf4ScaleCoherence}_S(A,J,\\lambda,\\vec f)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{ZfcPcf2Scale}_S(A,J,\\lambda,\\vec f)\\land\\exists P\\in V\\;\\Bigl[P=\\{g\\in\\mathcal P(A\\times\\bigcup A):\\mathrm{Function}(g,A,\\bigcup A)\\land\\forall a\\in A\\;(g(a)\\in a)\\}\\land\\forall\\delta\\in\\lambda\\;\\Bigl(\\operatorname{LimitOrdinal}_S(\\delta)\\to\\forall g\\in P\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{ZfcPcf3EventualOrder}_S(A,J,g,\\vec f(\\delta))\\to\\exists\\alpha<\\delta\\;\\mathrm{ZfcPcf3EventualOrder}_S(A,J,g,\\vec f(\\alpha))\\bigr)\\Bigr)\\Bigr]","display":true},{"tex":"f_\\delta","display":false}],"bytes":1684,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3092","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch20/58-df-zfc-pcf4-scale-coherence.md|58-df-zfc-pcf4-scale-coherence]]（batch20）"}],"outgoing":["255774e81caebda9","fd3c35fd522d89ac","5582a281f15a33c2","36d7463d215be751","81cabbac7fa4d75d"]}